<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Oct 24.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Oct 24.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>					   Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		   RIC	 Yield     Close</p>
<p> 1 Prime Credit Tr	 10.21    0.96</p>
<p> 2 Prop Income Inv	 10.06    1.01</p>
<p> 3 BT Prop Trust	    9.77    1.67</p>
<p> 4 Indu Property	    9.68    0.94</p>
<p> 5 McIntosh Sec	     9.68    0.93</p>
<p> 6 Villa World		9.65    1.14</p>
<p> 7 Colonial Mutual	  9.28    1.14</p>
<p> 8 Aust Tour		  9.15    0.82</p>
<p> 9 Central Equity	   9.00    1.00</p>
