<p>11 Centro Prop		8.78    2.22</p>
<p>12 Gandel Retail Tr	 8.67    0.90</p>
<p>13 Equitilink		 8.62    0.58</p>
<p>14 Gen Prop Tr		8.52    2.36</p>
